Andrei Tarkovsky's final masterpiece in a stunning 4K restoration.\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"Source Sans Pro, Arial, sans-serif\\\" size=\\\"3\\\"\\u003eAlexander, a journalist, philosopher and retired actor, celebrates a birthday with friends and family when it is announced that nuclear war has begun.\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"Source Sans Pro, Arial, sans-serif\\\" size=\\\"3\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"Source Sans Pro, Arial, sans-serif\\\" size=\\\"3\\\"\\u003eThe final film of Andrei Tarkovsky.\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"Source Sans Pro, Arial, sans-serif\\\" size=\\\"3\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"Source Sans Pro, Arial, sans-serif\\\" size=\\\"3\\\"\\u003e\\\"Brilliant and audacious, with one of the most extraordinary final sequences in modern cinema.\\\"\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"Source Sans Pro, Arial, sans-serif\\\" size=\\\"3\\\"\\u003e★★★★★ - Peter Bradshaw, Guardian\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"Source Sans Pro, Arial, sans-serif\\\" size=\\\"3\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"Source Sans Pro, Arial, sans-serif\\\" size=\\\"3\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":\"Andrei Tarkovsky\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":148,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"12A\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"nZmsramIzf4\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-31\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-07-31\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"437873\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"SACRIFICE (4