font face=\\\"HelveticaNeue\\\"\\u003eActOne is delighted to present a special screening and Q\\u0026amp;A with local director Darius Shu.\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"HelveticaNeue\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"HelveticaNeue\\\"\\u003eThe event is comprised of the screening of the shorts DEAR GOOGLE and MOLLY followed by a live conversation with the director.\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"HelveticaNeue\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"HelveticaNeue\\\"\\u003eDear Google\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"HelveticaNeue\\\"\\u003eA young boy's racial identity and insecurities emerge from the perspective of his Google browser search history.\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"HelveticaNeue\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"HelveticaNeue\\\"\\u003eMolly\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"HelveticaNeue\\\"\\u003eA chance encounter at a launderette sparks a meaningful connection between Vinnie and Ryan. As closeness blurs into desire, they are forced to confront what love demands before it fractures everything they have built.\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Starring Hiroki Berrecloth, Frank Kauer\",\"directedBy\":\"Darius Shu\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":60,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"tbc\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-08-01\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-08-01\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"337721\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Drover's Wife: The Legend Of Molly Johnson, The (2D) [15]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"141\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99301099994,\\\"daysShown\\\":10,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":false,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"Sc1\\\",\\\"Special event\\\",\\\"No Ads \\\\u0026 Trailers\\\",\\\"Q\\\\u0026A\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"Sc1\\\",\\\"Special event\\\",\\\"No Ads \\\\u0026 Trailers\\\",\\\"Q\\\\u0026A\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-special-event some-showings-sc1 some-showings-special-event some-showings-no-ads--trailers some-showings-qa every-showings-sc1 every-showings-special-event every-showings-no-ads--trailers every-showings-qa showing-status-on-sale\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"455017\",\"time\":\"2026-08-01T11:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":22,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":52,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc1 special-event no-ads--trailers qa\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"39834\",\"name\":\"CARERS \\u0026 BABIES: ISH\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"carers-babies-ish\",\"posterImage\":\"azg1k7lctg1p0rcnhs7ugqx910tf\",\"bannerImage\":\"sisohbbtgzm7erfctw3q6qmrk7qs\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cb style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003eThis performance is exclusive to our\\u0026nbsp;\\u003ca href=\\\"https://actonecinema.co.uk/carers--babies-club\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\\u003eCARERS \\u0026amp; BABIES CLUB\\u003c/a\\u003e. You must have at least one baby in your party aged 0-12 months old.\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eTwelve-year-old best friends, Ish and Maram wrestle to hold onto their friendship, in the wake of a traumatic police stop \\u0026amp; search. As the ripples take hold, the boys try to make sense of the men they are becoming – and how ‘letting go’ can be the hardest part of growing up.\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e★★★★ - Guardian\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Farhan Hasnat, Yahya Kitana, Avin Shah\",\"directedBy\":\"Imran Perretta\",\"producedBy\":\"Bennett McGhee, Dhiraj Mahey\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":89,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":\"Drama\",\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"fWvNcjOGTtM\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-08-04\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-08-04\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":0.5237,\"tmdbId\":\"1497480\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"502173\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"No Match Found\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"157\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99301399993,\\\"daysShown\\\":13,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":false,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"Carers \\\\u0026 Babies\\\",\\\"Sc1\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"Carers \\\\u0026 Babies\\\",\\\"Sc1\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-carers--babies some-showings-carers--babies some-showings-sc1 every-showings-carers--babies every-showings-sc1 showing-status-on-sale\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"466905\",\"time\":\"2026-08-04T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"carers--babies sc1\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"39338\",\"name\":\"MISAN HARRIMAN: SHOOT THE PEOPLE\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"misan-harriman-shoot-the-people\",\"posterImage\":\"ul31fxfqrvr4b638kf6vmgdlxn7e\",\"bannerImage\":\"gxq0735bo1zmd31yq95zn2g3dsix\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eShoot The People is a documentary capturing photographer and activist Misan Harriman’s journey documenting global protest movements that drive social change. Renowned for his wide-ranging work — including powerful breakthrough images from the 2020 Black Lives Matter protests and capturing the Palestinian liberation movement on film — Harriman also made history as the first Black man to photograph a British Vogue cover.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eThe film follows Harriman as he highlights the resilience of grassroots activists fighting for equality, civil rights, and social justice, the film showcases the intersectionality of these movements and their collective power. With historical context, interviews with activists, and explorations of digital activism, the documentary reveals how Harriman's lens brings the world's activism to light, inspiring viewers to recognize their own power in shaping a more just society.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e★★★★ - Little White Lies\\u0026nbsp;\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Misan Harriman\",\"directedBy\":\"Andy Mundy-Castle\",\"producedBy\":\"\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":95,\"genre\":\"Documentary\",\"allGenres\":\"Documentary\",\"rating\":\"12A\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"o1PRBUrIcR4\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-08-04\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-08-04\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":0.4058,\"tmdbId\":\"1490899\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"513393\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"SHOOT THE PEOPLE (2D) [12A]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"110\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99301399994,\\\"daysShown\\\":13,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":false,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"Sc2\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"Sc2\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-new-release some-showings-sc2 every-showings-sc2 showing-status-on-sale\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"466827\",\"time\":\"2026-08-04T19:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":3,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":57,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"39339\",\"name\":\"ClassicOne Cinema Club: GENTLEMEN PREFER BLONDES\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"classicone-cinema-club-gentlemen-prefer-blondes\",\"posterImage\":\"umlyvm66htpvkseqokny0f2odweu\",\"bannerImage\":\"eerfjesqav5af73hmurwfld5cwr9\",\"synopsis\":\"The\\u0026nbsp;\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003eClassicOne Cinema Club celebrates \\u003c/span\\u003eMarilyn Monroe's centenary\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;with\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/span\\u003eGentlemen Prefer Blondes.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eMarilyn Monroe and Jane Russell make a magnetic duo as two showgirls pursuing a match in Howard Hawks’ bedazzled classic comedy musical. The film is based on the 1949 stage musical of the same name, which in turn is based on the 1925 novel of the same name by Anita Loos.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e---\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cdiv style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003eWe’re bringing you a cinema club with a difference. To tie in with our lovely community library heritage, we are going to be screening classic films inspired by original books. Then, just like a book club, join other members in your screening for some complementary refreshments, to discuss your thoughts on the film and have a good old Acton get-together.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003eWhy not join us at our ClassicOne Cinema Club screenings and enjoy a good chat afterwards?\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003eAs a community cinema, we want to make the films accessible for all, so tickets are on a pay-what-you-can basis. Tickets for carers are free, and we welcome people living with dementia and care home residents. Please contact us if you want to bring a group.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003eProgramme supported by Film Hub London, managed by Film London. Proud to be a partner of the BFI Film Audience Network, funded by the National Lottery.v\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Jane Russell, Marilyn Monroe, Charles Coburn\",\"directedBy\":\"Howard Hawks\",\"producedBy\":\"Sol C. Siegel\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":91,\"genre\":\"Comedy\",\"allGenres\":\"Comedy, Romance\",\"rating\":\"U\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"TOqfJEPB8rI\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-08-04\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-08-04\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":3.5348,\"tmdbId\":\"759\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"No Match Found\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"159\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99301399994,\\\"daysShown\\\":13,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":false,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"ClassicOne Cinema Club\\\",\\\"Sc1\\\",\\\"Special event\\\",\\\"No Ads \\\\u0026 Trailers\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"ClassicOne Cinema Club\\\",\\\"Sc1\\\",\\\"Special event\\\",\\\"No Ads \\\\u0026 Trailers\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-classicone-cinema-club some-showings-classicone-cinema-club some-showings-sc1 some-showings-special-event some-showings-no-ads--trailers every-showings-classicone-cinema-club every-showings-sc1 every-showings-special-event every-showings-no-ads--trailers showing-status-on-sale\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"464677\",\"time\":\"2026-08-04T13:10:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":4,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":56,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"classicone-cinema-club sc1 special-event no-ads--trailers\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"39337\",\"name\":\"DAVID BYRNE'S AMERICAN UTOPIA\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"david-byrnes-american-utopia\",\"posterImage\":\"tbghs2qrffspslood2y3l1a2956r\",\"bannerImage\":\"gq9g1qi547y88muxov4fdim6shb8\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eSpike Lee documents the former Talking Heads frontman’s brilliant, timely 2019 Broadway show, based on his recent album and tour of the same name.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e‘Do we get stupider as we grow up?’ In his wildly popular Broadway show American Utopia, David Byrne reflects on human connections, life and how on earth we work through it. He joins the dots with his music and it all starts making sense. Spike Lee here transforms the production into immersive, dynamic cinema that radiates with astounding performances, inventive contemporary dance and political urgency. American Utopia flows like an iridescent dream vision. Work by James Baldwin, Janelle Monáe and Kurt Schwitters is highlighted among exhilarating renditions of Byrne’s solo work, as well as Talking Heads classics. According to the multi-hyphenate, we love looking at humans more than anything else. Anti-fascist and anti-racist, Byrne illuminates our responsibility to care for one another as he and his co-performers burn down the house.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003e★★★★★ - Empire Magazine\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e★★★★★ -\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/span\\u003eIndependent\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e★★★★★ - F\\u003c/span\\u003einancial\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;Times\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e★★★★ - Observer\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e★★★★ - Guardian\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e★★★★ - Little White Lies\\u0026nbsp;\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e★★★★ - London Evening Standard\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e★★★★ - Time Out\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e★★★★ - Rolling Stone\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"David Byrne, Chris Giarmo, Tendayi Kuumba\",\"directedBy\":\"Spike Lee\",\"producedBy\":\"\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":105,\"genre\":\"Music\",\"allGenres\":\"Music, Documentary\",\"rating\":\"12A\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"WZ2I-A4kNfM\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-08-05\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-08-05\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":0.657,\"tmdbId\":\"668800\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"328759\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"David byrne's american utopia [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"110\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99301499994,\\\"daysShown\\\":17,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":false,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"Sc2\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"Sc2\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-new-release some-showings-sc2 every-showings-sc2 showing-status-on-sale\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"466831\",\"time\":\"2026-08-05T19:40:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":58,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"466832\",\"time\":\"2026-08-06T16:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":6,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":54,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"467028\",\"time\":\"2026-08-08T14:10:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"17560\",\"name\":\"FUN IN THE LOUNGE - FREE ENTRY: BOARD GAMES\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"fun-at-the-lounge---free-entry-board-games\",\"posterImage\":\"zd1egphtlaiiru9m2qozcm3pk83r\",\"bannerImage\":\"e2jlqavsfbw2kiq8hw5fgu6hmi37\",\"synopsis\":\"FREE ENTRY - Please RSVP for free below so we can manage numbers - Donations help us keep our community events free!\\n\\nOur Board Games Evenings take place the first Wednesday of every month.\\n\\nGet notified of all our free events by becoming a member on our Meetup Groups: \\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.meetup.com/west-london-board-games-meetup-group/\\\"\\u003eWest London Board Games\\u003c/a\\u003e and \\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.meetup.com/free-open-mic-jazz-nights-in-west-london/\\\"\\u003eFree Open Mic \\u0026 Jazz Nights in West London\\u003c/a\\u003e!\\n\\nJoin us for an evening of gaming fun, chat and drinks! Whether you're a seasoned gamer or brand new to the world of board games, this event is perfect for everyone. You can bring and host your own games, join other people's games or play one from our newbie-friendly collection. If you don't know how to play a game someone will teach you and if you come alone we'll help you find a group.\\n\\nSome notes:\\nYou can join anytime after 6pm, but the earliest you come, the easier will be to find a group.\\nAll the games either belong to the group or to individuals who come to the meetup. Please take good care of all games - be careful with nearby drinks, help put everything back in the box after you're done and return them to the owner/organiser.\\nWe are of course LGBTQI+ friendly!\\nPets are welcome!\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":null,\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":240,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-08-05\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-08-05\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"37604\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"All The Best - The Fun Begins (2D) [PG]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"277\",\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"magicSortValue\\\":99301499995,\\\"daysShown\\\":14,\\\"nowPlayingOrHasPlayed\\\":false,\\\"someShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"Fun in the Lounge\\\"],\\\"everyShowingsBadges\\\":[\\\"Fun in the Lounge\\\"],\\\"leavesSoon\\\":false,\\\"lastDayTomorrow\\\":false,\\\"lastDayToday\\\":false,\\\"classes\\\":\\\"title-class-fun-in-the-lounge some-showings-fun-in-the-lounge every-showings-fun-in-the-lounge showing-status-on-sale\\\"}\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"216648\",\"time\":\"2024-09-04T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":4,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":46,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"special-event fun-at-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"221735\",\"time\":\"2024-10-02T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":7,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":43,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"special-event fun-at-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"234090\",\"time\":\"2024-11-06T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":16,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":34,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-at-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"247070\",\"time\":\"2024-12-04T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":8,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":42,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-at-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"254699\",\"time\":\"2025-01-08T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":20,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":30,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-at-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"264142\",\"time\":\"2025-02-05T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":20,\"